{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your caf\u00e9, master the daily grind behind the counter, and grow your little business one cup at a time. Every item, every tool, and every step is designed to feel intuitive, satisfying, and full of personality. Want to place your favorite mug by the window? Go for it. Dreaming of a plant-filled nook surrounded by espresso machines? Nothing\u2019s stopping you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae WHAT TO EXPECT:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/03dc026325e6fe5d865c1751fe43d925.avif?t=1755455804\" width=1153 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind, brew, steam, and pour - every step matters when crafting the perfect cup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/fcc6ce82753888f061f486e26f6c926f.poster.avif?t=1755455804\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/fcc6ce82753888f061f486e26f6c926f.webm?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/fcc6ce82753888f061f486e26f6c926f.mp4?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/e9f766da7a707383af2e8dc631438062.avif?t=1755455804\" width=1153 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn milk into real art: pour hearts, tulips, and more as you level up and unlock new designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/b6450eb2c9fac5054aea0eeb5df1a675.poster.avif?t=1755455804\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/b6450eb2c9fac5054aea0eeb5df1a675.webm?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/b6450eb2c9fac5054aea0eeb5df1a675.mp4?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/c9144ba9708b3658bc25f4f619cd8642.avif?t=1755455804\" width=1153 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange furniture, fine-tune the lighting, and shape the mood of your caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/0f2dfab816e818d3c84fb08da6eed6ca.poster.avif?t=1755455804\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/0f2dfab816e818d3c84fb08da6eed6ca.webm?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/0f2dfab816e818d3c84fb08da6eed6ca.mp4?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/e1062aafe1bf8ba55c1f47dd6c7ec897.avif?t=1755455804\" width=1153 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve guests, fulfill orders, keep satisfaction high, and turn your caf\u00e9 into the go-to local spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/69f57448be2e24c0f970f7ea92e33d4b.poster.avif?t=1755455804\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/69f57448be2e24c0f970f7ea92e33d4b.webm?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/69f57448be2e24c0f970f7ea92e33d4b.mp4?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/35414f7b7fc421a2e4561643fa9adfe3.avif?t=1755455804\" width=1153 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock up on beans, milk, equipment, and everything else you need to keep things running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/888de0bda4784c8c0add95cdf918ece2.poster.avif?t=1755455804\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/888de0bda4784c8c0add95cdf918ece2.webm?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/888de0bda4784c8c0add95cdf918ece2.mp4?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/e42fdf13f4df11c96a63253734c1cd17.avif?t=1755455804\" width=1153 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use realistic gear - from portafilters to matcha whisks - and feel like a true barista.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/f4718be97a019670f45ec913d8ffc2d7.poster.avif?t=1755455804\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/f4718be97a019670f45ec913d8ffc2d7.webm?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/f4718be97a019670f45ec913d8ffc2d7.mp4?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/4b480ded3ce2ad6e1f4069464280206f.avif?t=1755455804\" width=1153 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wipe down the counter, tidy up after customers, and keep your caf\u00e9 a place people want to come back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/aef11e796ef9a2c0e31ad829e791eaeb.poster.avif?t=1755455804\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/aef11e796ef9a2c0e31ad829e791eaeb.webm?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/aef11e796ef9a2c0e31ad829e791eaeb.mp4?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_im