tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/41bb8f4eba723918546e70b19c5d7c83f26db4a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755455804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your caf\u00e9, master the daily grind behind the counter, and grow your little business one cup at a time. Every item, every tool, and every step is designed to feel intuitive, satisfying, and full of personality. Want to place your favorite mug by the window? Go for it. Dreaming of a plant-filled nook surrounded by espresso machines? Nothing\u2019s stopping you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae WHAT TO EXPECT:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/03dc026325e6fe5d865c1751fe43d925.avif?t=1755455804\" width=1153 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind, brew, steam, and pour - every step matters when crafting the perfect cup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/fcc6ce82753888f061f486e26f6c926f.poster.avif?t=1755455804\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/fcc6ce82753888f061f486e26f6c926f.webm?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/fcc6ce82753888f061f486e26f6c926f.mp4?t=17