=1755455804\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/aef11e796ef9a2c0e31ad829e791eaeb.webm?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/aef11e796ef9a2c0e31ad829e791eaeb.mp4?t=1755455804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/206e3677e1b750d98e26547eeffe35db.avif?t=1755455804\" width=1153 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own drink menu, add new creations, and set your prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/3ccda979cfd73320d86fbd7f55167b3d.avif?t=1755455804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras_big/3ccda979cfd73320d86fbd7f55167b3d.avif?t=1755455804 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/0c243b4599e59cfd9036a5af21102ae7.avif?t=1755455804\" width=1153 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on odd jobs outside the caf\u00e9 - like fixing pipes, rewiring lights, or gardening - to earn extra cash for upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909770/extras/f9dcb8c2677b9c59aa44c2231ef30566.avif?t=1755455804\" width=1153 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small coffee shop and grow it step by step. Hone your 